amoto</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sato</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Sakamoto</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Nishio</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Distribution of similar self-incompatibility (S) haplotypes in different genera, Raphanus and Brassica</article-title><source>Sex Plant Reprod</source><year>2004</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>33</fpage><lpage>39</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00497-004-0211-2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schierup</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Mable</surname><given-names>BK</given-names></name><name><surname>Awadalla</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Charlesworth</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Identification and characterization of a polymorphic receptor kinase gene linked to the self-incompatibility locus of <italic>Arabidopsis lyrata</italic></article-title><source>Genetics</source><year>2001</year><volume>158</volume><fpage>387</fpage><lpage>399</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11333247</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kusaba</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsushita</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Okazaki</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Satta</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Nishio</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Sequence and structural diversity of the S locus genes from different lines with the same self-recognition specificities in <italic>Brassica oleracea</italic></article-title><source>Genetics</source><year>2000</year><volume>154</volume><fpage>413</f